    <h2>Redacting secrets</h2>
    <h4 style="color: #7A6F66;">A committed file is not a vault</h4>
    <aside class="notes">
        <p>Let's start with secrets. And I'll sum up the philosophy in one sentence: a committed file is not a vault.</p>
        <p>The workflow we've just seen asks you to commit the recordings. So everything in those files ends up in your Git repository, in its history, and maybe one day on GitHub.</p>
    </aside>
